  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "The interest rates on loans issued by the bank from September 1 are as follows."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>I. Consumer loans:</strong>"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>1. Auto credit</strong>"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Interest rate;"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": false,
   "items": [
    "25 percent for independent applicants;",
    "21 percent on contracts with salons;",
    "18 percent on any collateral and contracts with salons."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>2. Cash loan:</strong>"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Interest rate -16 percent;"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>3. Loans for retirees:</strong>"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Interest rate -22 percent;"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>4. Collateral for gold and gold jewelry:</strong>"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Interest rate -26 percent;"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>5. Loans for employees of state enterprises:</strong>"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Interest rate -22 percent;"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>6. Loan with real estate collateral:</strong>"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Interest rate -21 percent;"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>7. Employees of non-governmental organizations:</strong>"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Interest rate -26 percent;"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>8. Credit cards:</strong>"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Interest rate -27 percent;"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>II. Business loans:</strong>"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Interest rate -21-23 percent;"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>Note:</strong> Other parts (items) of Baku branch’s “Credit policy for 2017” remain in force"
  },
  {
